        "title": "The chart below shows the process of waste paper recycling. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the process of waste paper recycling. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Waste Paper Recycling Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Waste Paper Recycling Process y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế giấy thải.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Waste Paper Recycling Process với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế giấy thải để sản xuất c&aacute;c sản phẩm giấy c&oacute; thể sử dụng được.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với đề Waste Paper Recycling Process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-U4ardJtyNohd1Nxpcu6lfh60gyf\">Quy tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế giấy thải bao gồm <strong>s&aacute;u giai đoạn ch&iacute;nh: </strong>bắt đầu với việc thu gom giấy thải v&agrave; <strong>kết th&uacute;c bằng việc sản xuất giấy mới</strong> <em>(culminating in the production of new paper)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua <strong>sản xuất m&aacute;y m&oacute;c</strong> <em>(machine manufacturing)</em>.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QsD9d6WuIolydox7aoxleFqtgkg\">Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; <strong>một quy tr&igrave;nh tuần ho&agrave;n</strong> <em>(a cyclical process)</em> biến đổi <strong>vật liệu giấy bỏ đi </strong><em>(discarded paper materials)</em> th&agrave;nh sản phẩm c&oacute; thể t&aacute;i sử dụng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QsD9d6WuIolydox7aoxleFqtgkg\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><u><strong>4.</strong></u><u><strong> Ph&acirc;n body r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></u></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Waste Paper Recycling Process một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp;4 giai đoạn đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XcGedO5NUoH1Ecx2IrAl4DJggmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu với việc thu gom giấy thải từ hai <strong>nguồn ch&iacute;nh</strong> (<em>primary sources)</em>: <strong>ng&acirc;n h&agrave;ng giấy c&ocirc;ng cộng v&agrave; doanh nghiệp</strong> <em>(public paper banks and businesses)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lz1Idlw4ooeOjwx6sA6lRYRmg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau khi thu gom, giấy thải được <strong>ph&acirc;n loại bằng tay</strong> <em>(sorting by hand)</em>, trong đ&oacute; giấy <strong>được ph&acirc;n hạng theo chất lượng</strong> <em>(be graded according to quality)</em> v&agrave; vật liệu kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; hợp được loại bỏ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sbdad8ZNmo8MsGxRSsXlYGttgQh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Giấy đ&atilde; được ph&acirc;n loại</strong> <em>(The sorted paper)</em> sau đ&oacute; được vận chuyển đến <strong>nh&agrave; m&aacute;y giấy</strong> <em>(paper mills)</em> để <strong>xử l&yacute; th&ecirc;m</strong> <em>(further processing)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JExgdCj8Koqk5lx4cJflarRbgSg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khi đến nh&agrave; m&aacute;y giấy, <strong>giấy thải bước v&agrave;o giai đoạn l&agrave;m sạch</strong>, nơi n&oacute; trải qua việc l&agrave;m sạch, <strong>nghiền bột </strong><em>(pulping) </em>v&agrave; loại bỏ vật liệu kh&aacute;c như <strong>kim bấm</strong> <em>(staples)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 2 bước cuối của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JuQ2dBUBKomN61xTia8lkmsHgTd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tiếp theo, giấy chuyển đến <strong>giai đoạn khử mực</strong> <em>(the de-inking phase)</em>, trong đ&oacute; mực v&agrave; keo được loại bỏ khỏi <strong>vật liệu bột giấy</strong> <em>(the pulped material)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Aq3pdfF8So1LNSxiOoZlRgWEgxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Cuối c&ugrave;ng, bột giấy đ&atilde; được l&agrave;m sạch v&agrave; khử mực được đưa v&agrave;o <strong>m&aacute;y sản xuất giấy</strong> <em>(paper making machines)</em>, sản xuất c&aacute;c sản phẩm giấy c&oacute; thể sử dụng được, từ đ&oacute; ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh <strong>chu tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế</strong> <em>(the recycling cycle)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2012,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The diagram illustrates the process by which waste paper is recycled to produce usable paper products.</p>",
            "question_id": 18747,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2013,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the waste paper recycling process consists of six main stages, beginning with the collection of waste paper and culminating in the production of new paper through machine manufacturing. This represents a cyclical process that transforms discarded paper materials into reusable products.</p>",
            "question_id": 18747,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2014,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>The process commences with the collection of waste paper from two primary sources: public paper banks and businesses. Following collection, the waste paper undergoes sorting by hand, during which paper is graded according to quality and unsuitable materials are removed. The sorted paper is then transported to paper mills for further processing.</p>",
            "question_id": 18747,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2015,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Upon arrival at the paper mill, the waste paper enters the cleaning stage, where it undergoes cleaning, pulping, and the removal of other materials such as staples. Subsequently, the paper moves to the de-inking phase, during which inks and glues are eliminated from the pulped material. Finally, the cleaned and de-inked pulp is fed into paper making machines, which manufacture usable paper products, thereby completing the recycling cycle.</p>",
            "question_id": 18747,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
